        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Pursuant to the IconOVir Agreement, from the Closing Date until the earlier of the 10th anniversary of the Closing Date and the first commercial sale of any ICVB Product in any jurisdiction, we agreed to use commercially reasonable efforts to develop and commercialize one ICVB Product.",
